sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant N as Neon Auth
  participant A as FastAPI
  participant D as Application DB
  C->>N: Sign in through supported flow
  N-->>C: Supported credential or session
  C->>A: Request with credential
  Note over A,N: Verification method must be confirmed in Phase 3
  A->>N: Verify credential or session if required by documented flow
  N-->>A: Verified stable subject
  A->>D: Resolve UserProfile and query user-scoped data
  D-->>A: Authorized records
  A-->>C: Validated response
